    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1415">

                <pb facs="1199" n="1095" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1095"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 819.77/140.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            American Minister.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-01-20">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 20, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your January 19. Before finally expressing opinion Department desires to examine
                    text of the proposed bill and your report. Meantime it considers that its
                    presentation to Panaman Assembly should be delayed.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Knox</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
